        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek BTB-87005, Tribeca Back-to-Back Handle Pair</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Tribeca Back-to-Back Door Handle Set will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 2-1/4 inches thick. The Tribeca Back-to-Back Handle Pair comes packaged as a 2 pulls and mounting hardware. The Tribeca Door Pull Pair is available in 12 inch and 18 inch lengths. This Faceted Door Pull goes well with almost any decor. Choose from several beautiful finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. Packaged with 2 door pulls (1 door pull for each side of a door).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/tribeca-door-handle-emtek-87005\"><b>Tribeca Pull with Thru-Bolt Mounting</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Back-to-Back Tribeca Front Door Handle Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-87005-specifications.pdf?v=1704262416\"><b>Emtek Tribeca Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-BTB-87005:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 15\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-BTB-87006:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 21\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back-to-Back mounting.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-levers-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354533\" width=\"599\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
